context:
DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/dlp/profiles/custom/{profile_id}
Deletes a DLP custom profile.
Required: account_id (path); profile_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/dlp/profiles/predefined/{profile_id}
This is a no-op as predefined profiles can't be deleted but is needed for our generated terraform API.
Required: account_id (path); profile_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/dlp/profiles/custom/{profile_id}
Fetches a custom DLP profile by id.
Required: account_id (path); profile_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/dlp/profiles/{profile_id}
Fetches a DLP profile by ID.
Required: account_id (path); profile_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/dlp/profiles/predefined/{profile_id}
Fetches a predefined DLP profile by id.
Required: account_id (path); profile_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/dlp/profiles/custom/{profile_id}
Updates a DLP custom profile.
Required: account_id (path); profile_id (path); body (body) — The updated parameters for the profile.

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/dlp/profiles/predefined/{profile_id}
Updates a DLP predefined profile. Only supports enabling/disabling entries.
Required: account_id (path); profile_id (path); body (body) — The updated parameters for the predefined profile.
